185
00:12:21,904 --> 00:12:26,197
We'll compare what each level
can do in the next video.

186
00:12:26,697 --> 00:12:30,474
The crew arrives, takes over CPR
from Maya, and keeps it going.

187
00:12:30,524 --> 00:12:35,199
{1}On the way, they radio a report
ahead, so the hospital is ready when

188
00:12:35,249 --> 00:12:39,907
