Frank to the emergency department,

189
00:12:39,957 --> 00:12:43,869
the ED. {2}And the ED is the
gateway to the rest of the hospital.

190
00:12:43,919 --> 00:12:49,647
From there he can move on to the
operating room, the OR, {3}to specialists,

191
00:12:49,697 --> 00:12:51,497
{4}or to a bed upstairs.

192
00:12:51,997 --> 00:12:54,091
But not every hospital can do everything.

193
00:12:54,141 --> 00:12:56,263
{1}Some are specialty centers.

194
00:12:56,313 --> 00:13:00,686
{2}A major trauma center keeps surgical
